'''Lolly Fanciers''' (ぺろきゃん愛好家, ''Perokyan Aikōka'', '''Lollipop Lovers''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
"Slow" Effect UP (Sm): Slow duration increases by 10%.

